                            combine(vehicle, page, refresh) ▸ flatMapLatest(trips) ▸ asUiState feed; interaction
                            (page) StateFlow; displayPrefs StateFlow; setPage / refresh / retry / recordViewOpened.
  TripListPage.kt           stateful entry + stateless content; loading skeleton / empty / error-retry / success;
                            the four summary MetricCards in a responsive 2/4-col grid; the ChartContainer +
                            BarChart with CSV/JSON share export; the "All Trips" GlassPanel list of TripRows;
                            pagination. SI converted only at the display boundary; Compose-native (no webview).
